# EasyPro backend

- Production API: **https://api.easypro.mn/api**
- Deploy: [DEPLOY.md](../DEPLOY.md)
- Local: `DB_ENGINE=sqlite` · Prod: `DB_ENGINE=mysql`

```bash
python manage.py migrate
python manage.py seed_master_data   # prod OK
python manage.py seed_demo_data     # dev only (blocked if DEBUG=False)
python manage.py collectstatic --noinput
```

- Production data policy: [docs/PRODUCTION.md](../docs/PRODUCTION.md)
- Frontend (sibling repo): Next.js on Vercel, `NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL`
